# Platform files compiled from library content — regenerate with compilers
# .claude/agents/*.md
# .claude/rules/*.md

# Branch libraries live beside their code in the project repos, never here.
# The identity repo is the organization identity: .claude/, CLAUDE.md, README.md.
# The commit tool mirrors library/*/.lib into .lib/ from project working copies —
# this keeps that mirror from ever being committed to the identity repo again.
.lib/
